%% Source: Mermaid's stateDiagram-v2 "hello world" example.
%% A vehicle has three states. From Still you can either stay (return to Still
%% from a trip via Moving), or progress to Crash (terminal).
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Still
    Still --> [*]

    Still --> Moving
    Moving --> Still
    Moving --> Crash
    Crash --> [*]
